   "lines": [
    "Raining again! I have",
    "had most awful",
    "luck in weather",
    "this time. Monday",
    "so rough we couldn't",
    "go out; Tuesday so",
    "calm we couldn't",
    "get anywhere, yesterday",
    "and today raining."
   ],
